      </size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1_2
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>WILD</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_2
    value: <size=18>-<indent=10>Wild substitutes for all symbols except Scatter symbol.</size></indent>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32>FREE GAMES</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: '<size=20>

      -<indent=10>Whenever              appears, there is
      a chance the <b><color=green>Expanding</color> Feature</b> may be triggered.</indent>

      -<indent=10>Whenever             
      appears, there is a chance the <b><color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b> may
      be triggered.</indent>

      -<indent=10>Whenever              appears, there
      is a chance the <b><color=purple>Fortune</color> Feature</b> may be triggered.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If
      only <b><color=green>Expanding</color> Feature</b> is triggered in the spin,
      the <b><color=green>Expanding</color> Feature</b> is awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If
      only <b><color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b> is triggered in the spin, the
      <b><color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b> is awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If
      only <b><color=purple>Fortune</color> Feature</b> is triggered in the spin,
      the <b><color=purple>Fortune</color> Feature</b> is awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If
      only <b><color=green>Expanding</color> Feature</b> and <b><color=red>Jackpot</color>
      Feature</b> are triggered in the same spin, the <b><color=green>Expanding</color>
      <color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b> is awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If
      only <b><color=purple>Fortune</color> Feature</b> and <b><color=red>Jackpot</color>
      Feature</b> are triggered in the same spin, the <b><color=purple>Fortune</color>
      <color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b> is awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If
      only <b><color=green>Expanding</color> Feature</b> and <b><color=purple>Fortune</color>
      Feature</b> are triggered in the same spin, the <b><color=green>Expanding</color>
      <color=purple>Fortune</color> Feature</b> is awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If
      <b><color=green>Expanding</color> Feature</b>, <b><color=purple>Fortune</color>
      Feature</b> and <b><color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b> are triggered in
      the same spin, the <b><color=green>Expanding</color> <color=purple>Fortune</color>
      <color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b> is awarded.</indent>

      </size>


'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: '<size=20>

      -<indent=10>At the conclusion of <b><color=green>Expanding</color>
      Feature</b>, <b><color=purple>Fortune</color> Feature</b> or <b><color=green>Expanding</color>
      <color=purple>Fortune</color> Feature</b>, one feature may be triggered as
      determined by the combination of feature triggers collected.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If
      only <b><color=green>Expanding</color> Feature</b> trigger was collected, the
      <b><color=green>Expanding</color> Feature</b> will be awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If
      only <b><color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b> trigger was collected, the <b><color=red>Jackpot</color>
      Feature</b> will be awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If only <b><color=purple>Fortune</color>
      Feature</b> trigger was collected, the <b><color=purple>Fortune</color> Feature</b>
      will be awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If only <b><color=green>Expanding</color>
      Feature</b> and <b><color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b> triggers were collected,
      the <b><color=green>Expanding</color> <color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b>
      will be awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If only <b><color=purple>Fortune</color>
      Feature</b> and <b><color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b> triggers were collected,
      the <b><color=purple>Fortune</color> <color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b>
      will be awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If only <b><color=green>Expanding</color>
      Feature</b> and <b><color=purple>Fortune</color> Feature</b> triggers were
      collected, the <b><color=green>Expanding</color> <color=purple>Fortune</color>
      Feature</b> will be awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>If <b><color=green>Expanding</color>
      Feature</b>, <b><color=purple>Fortune</color> Feature</b> and <b><color=red>Jackpot</color>
      Feature</b> triggers were collected, the <b><color=green>Expanding</color>
      <color=purple>Fortune</color> <color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</b> will be
      awarded.</indent>

      </size>


'
  - key: 
    value: 
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32><color=green>EXPANDING</color> FEATURE</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: '<size=21>

      -<indent=10>5 Free Games are awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>Wild
      symbol becomes 2x1 size symbol during <b><color=green>Expanding</color></b>
      Feature.</indent>

      -<indent=10>100 Lines are played during <b><color=green>Expanding</color></b>
      Feature.</indent>

      -<indent=10>Reel set becomes 6x5 during <b><color=green>Expanding</color></b>
      Feature.</indent>

      -<indent=10>Bottom 4 rows are active by default and
      top 2 rows stay locked unless a full wild symbol appears on active rows.</indent>

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_3_2
    value: <b><style=title><size=32><color=purple>Fortune</color> Feature</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_2
    value: '<size=21>

      -<indent=10>5 Free Games are awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>Line
      wins are multiplied by 2, 3 or 5 during <b><color=purple>Fortune</color></b>
      Feature.</indent>

      -<indent=10>Every            that appears during <b><color=purple>Fortune</color></b>
      Feature awards +2 Free Games, +1 Free Game or Credit prizes.</indent>

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_4_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32><color=red>Jackpot</color> Feature</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_4_1
    value: "<size=20>-<indent=10>10 Free Games are awarded.</indent>\n-<indent=10>          
      ,            and            are replaced by           during <b><color=red>Jackpot</color></b>
      Feature.</indent>\n-<indent=10>Every           that appears during the feature
      will award a Letter or Credit prize.</indent>\n-<indent=10>Possible Letters
      for the Grand Jackpot are            ,           ,            ,\n          
      and           .</indent>\n-<indent=10>Possible Letters for the Major Jackpot
      are            ,           ,            ,\n           and           .</indent>\n-<indent=10>Possible
      Letters for the Minor Jackpot are            ,           ,            ,\n          
      and           .</indent>\n-<indent=10>Possible Letters for the Mini Jackpot
      are            ,            (x2) and\n           .</indent>\n-<indent=10>If
      all Letters for a Jackpot are collected, the corresponding Jackpot is awarded,
      and the collected Letters for that Jackpot are reset.</indent>\n-<indent=10>Jackpot
      meter amount is reset after it has been paid during the feature.</indent>\n-<indent=10>If
      the same Jackpot is awarded multiple times during the feature, progressive
      is awarded only for the first time. Base Jackpot amount is awarded afterward.</indent>\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_5_1
    value: <b><style=title><size=32><color=green>Expanding</color> <color=purple>Fortune</color>
      Feature</style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5_1
    value: '<size=21>

      -<indent=10>5 Free Games are awarded.</indent>

      -<indent=10>Wild
      symbol becomes 2x1 size symbol during <b><color=green>Expanding</color> <color=purple>Fortune</color></b>
      Feature.</indent>

      -<indent=10>100 Lines are played during <b><color=green>Expanding</color>
      <color=purple>Fortune</color></b> Feature.</indent>

      -<indent=10>Reel
      set becomes 6x5 during <b><color=green>Expanding</color> <color=purple>Fortune</color></b>
